In function `USBD_CMPSIT_AddToConfDesc()`, the last argument passed to each one of the `USBD_CMPSIT_AssignEp()` function calls has been changed, as shown below...

```diff
      /* Set IN endpoint slot */
      iEp = pdev->tclasslist[pdev->classId].EpAdd[0];
